      "keystrokes": "printf 'Require Import Arith.\\n\\nTheorem plus_comm : forall n m : nat,\\n  n + m = m + n.\\nProof.\\n  intros n m.\\n  generalize dependent m.\\n  induction n.\\n  - intros m. simpl. reflexivity.\\n  - intros m IH. simpl. assumption\\nQed.' > plus_comm.v\n",
